flowchart LR
 subgraph Local[Local development]
  H1[Host process] -->|stdin/stdout JSONL| S1[STDIO MCP server]
  S1 --> D1[Domain tools]
 end
 subgraph Remote[Remote deployment]
  C[Remote MCP client] -->|HTTPS POST /mcp| TLS[TLS edge proxy]
  TLS --> V[Host + Origin + size + header validation]
  V --> O[OAuth middleware]
  O --> LB[Load balancer]
  LB --> R1[Stateless replica A]
  LB --> R2[Stateless replica B]
  LB --> R3[Stateless replica C]
  R1 --> G[Domain policy gateway]
  R2 --> G
  R3 --> G
  G --> DB[(Durable state + audit)]
 end
